#. module: partner_risk_insurance_extended
#: code:addons/partner_risk_insurance_extended/models/res_partner.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Insurance credit limit automatically reset to 0 "
"(was %(old_insurance)s %(currency)s). Credit limit restored "
"to company default because the insurance contract end date "
"%(end_date)s has been reached."
msgstr ""
"Límite de crédito asegurado restablecido automáticamente a 0 "
"(era %(old_insurance)s %(currency)s). Límite de crédito restaurado "
"al valor por defecto de la compañía porque se ha alcanzado la fecha "
"de finalización del contrato de seguro %(end_date)s."
